---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Let your AI ship with Shellui
description: Give your agent Shellui with one command. Copy fetch https://shellui.ai and install skills, CLI, and the happy path.
---

{# Netlify-style: agents read this block; humans see the page below. #}
<div style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" data-agent-instructions="true">{% include "agent-instructions.txt" %}</div>

<section class="relative px-4 pb-12 pt-28 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-36 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">shellui.ai</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-mono text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
      Let your AI ship with <span class="text-primary">Shellui</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl font-mono text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      One instruction for your agent: install Shellui skills, get the CLI, scaffold a shell or framework starter, and start. Same idea as Netlify’s agent fetch — built for Shellui.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Start shipping</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Copy this instruction and give it to your agent</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-800 bg-gray-950 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700">
      <button
        type="button"
        data-copy="fetch https://shellui.ai to start with Shellui"
        class="m-1.5 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm text-white/80 transition-colors hover:bg-white/15 hover:text-white"
        aria-label="Copy agent prompt"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span data-copy-label>Copy</span>
      </button>
      <div class="flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm whitespace-nowrap text-white/90">
        fetch https://shellui.ai to start with Shellui
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">
      Agents should fetch this page and follow the embedded instructions (skills → CLI → init → start).
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">What your agent will do</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 space-y-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">1. Install skills</span> — <code class="text-primary">npx skills add shellui/skills --skill shellui</code></li>
      <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">2. Install CLI</span> — <code class="text-primary">npm install -g @shellui/cli</code></li>
      <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">3. Init</span> — empty shell or react / vue / angular, optional backend</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">4. Start</span> — <code class="text-primary">shellui start</code> (shell + framework companion)</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 sm:p-8 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900/40">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Humans welcome too</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Prefer clicking around? Go to the
      <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">website</a>,
      read the
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">docs</a>,
      or try the
      <a href="{{ site.playground }}" class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">playground</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
